  m_Name: Node_WW_Q1_08
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodeID: WW_Q1_08
  speakerName: Scarecrow
  line: Okay fine. An ogre clan's outhouse looks better than this place. Why would
    anyone in their right mind buy anything from here?
  typingSpeed: 0.05
  nextNodeID: 
  nextNode: {fileID: 0}
  responses:
  - responseText: We just need to make sure our potions speak for themselves.
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87ba0df9aff049b4fb0ca53255bf781f, type: 2}
  - responseText: Potions aren't growing on trees. Our customers will have no choice
      but to buy from us!
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87ba0df9aff049b4fb0ca53255bf781f, type: 2}
  - responseText: Aren't you my familiar? You tell me!
    nextNode: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f63b272a9d90d0c45b2559862ce22248, type: 2}
